#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:5 86480c3e851d45ecbc4858726ba700fa
msgid "Calibration: Flight Modes"
msgstr "校准：飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:7 c43532e39b9a4084833fba1b09b53ad0
msgid ""
"This article shows how to use APM Planner to select flight modes and save "
"them to your transmitter's switch positions. For other calibration tasks see"
" :ref:`Autopilot calibration <autopilot-calibration>`."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何使用 APM Planner 选择飞行模式并将其保存到遥控器的开关位置。有关其他校准任务，请参阅 :ref:`飞控校准 "
"<autopilot-calibration>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:12 0b77225e6632488daff2079aba28ff50
msgid "1 Prerequisites"
msgstr "1 前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:14 c424f40ea17b44c1a5a49d42c412d015
msgid "Before preforming setup, ensure that:"
msgstr "在执行设置之前，请确保："

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:16 a18cbdbaf27a41b2b0f277d19e6f85c0
msgid "The vehicle is completely built to flight condition."
msgstr "飞行器已完整组装至可飞行状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:17 b167aed84dd344a89ed0deea24d9cc93
msgid ":ref:`Firmware has been loaded onto the autopilot. <install-firmware>`"
msgstr ":ref:`固件已加载到飞控中。 <install-firmware>`"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:18 786d06d0dfa44eafa24811b9f1813be1
msgid ""
":ref:`Autopilot is connected to APM Planner and connected to MavLink. "
"<connect-autopilot>`"
msgstr ":ref:`飞控已连接至 APM Planner 并连接至 MAVLink。 <connect-autopilot>`"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:19 30b8f518984b4dfdadf8133ff6bcc2b5
msgid ":ref:`Radio calibration is complete. <radio-calibration>`"
msgstr ":ref:`遥控器校准已完成。 <radio-calibration>`"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:22 df216cc7059d4828a7c8bdc1301bdfce
msgid "2 Assign Flight Modes"
msgstr "2 分配飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:24 4ce424639e6f44e68c6c66d856fe4386
msgid ""
"Under Mandatory Hardware, select Flight Modes. Turn on your transmitter and "
"move the switches to their available positions to see which flight mode will"
" apply to each position. The currently selected position is shown "
"highlighted in green. Select a flight mode for each available switch "
"position. Some sample modes for copters are shown below."
msgstr ""
"在「Mandatory Hardware」（必要硬件）下，选择「Flight "
"Modes」（飞行模式）。打开遥控器并拨动开关至各可用位置，查看每个位置对应的飞行模式。当前所选位置以绿色高亮显示。为每个可用的开关位置选择一个飞行模式。以下是多旋翼的一些示例模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:33 3d28d442e6d3406e9c11c5c39685bef4
msgid "Select Save to save the flight modes to the autopilot."
msgstr "选择「Save」将飞行模式保存至飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:35 f7c2857b74104bc6955df1e0fa333e3d
msgid ""
"Click here to learn about available :ref:`flight modes for copter "
"<copter:flight-modes>` and :ref:`flight modes for planes <plane:flight-"
"modes>`."
msgstr ""
"点击此处了解 :ref:`多旋翼可用飞行模式 <copter:flight-modes>` 和 :ref:`固定翼可用飞行模式 "
"<plane:flight-modes>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:38 09d595725bec4ed49dfcecf8dcb82c30
msgid "3 Simple Mode (copter only)"
msgstr "3 Simple 模式（仅限多旋翼）"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:40 eea59e91f2364b9b88d32013e703d4f0
msgid ""
"To apply simple mode to any of your selected flight modes, check the simple "
"mode box next to that mode. For more information about simple mode, "
":ref:`visit the wiki page here <copter:simpleandsuper-simple-modes>`."
msgstr ""
"若要将 Simple 模式应用于任何已选飞行模式，请勾选该模式旁边的 Simple 模式复选框。有关 Simple 模式的更多信息，请 "
":ref:`访问此 Wiki 页面 <copter:simpleandsuper-simple-modes>`。"
